    "detailed_description": "Play as the developer of a tropical island game in this unique puzzle adventure! \ud83c\udfdd Edit various object properties to achieve your goals and unlock more of the story. Experiment, undo, and repeat; no action is irreversible. Flex your creative skills to make an experience that is entirely your own!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A relaxed environment with no time limits or irreversible consequences<br></li><li>Puzzles that allude to some of the problems that game developers solve on a daily basis<br></li><li>A meta storyline<br></li><li>Laws of nature... and some defiance of those laws<br></li><li>Art, music, programming, and design made by a solo developer<br></li><li>Additional art, music, programming, and design made by... YOU!</li></ul><br>[SOLVE PUZZLES]<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756220/extras/4deab03cc681ef70785df139b1893752.poster.avif?t=1682356182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756220/extras/4deab03cc681ef70785df139b1893752.webm?t=1682356182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756220/extras/4deab03cc681ef70785df139b1893752.mp4?t=1682356182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>[MEET QUIRKY CHARACTERS]<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756220/extras/57b11f1b19297cde075fbd025485326c.poster.avif?t=1682356182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756220/extras/57b11f1b19297cde075fbd025485326c.webm?t=1682356182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756220/extras/57b11f1b19297cde